>Root Cause :</b> This incident is caused by a software issue.\n\nWe apologize for any inconvenience caused and appreciate your understanding.", "created_at": "2026-10-08T18:15:30.528Z"}]}, {"id": "5mb5m9d1p23d", "name": "[GLOBAL][Databases] - PostgreSQL 18 and PostGIS Compatibility Issue", "status": "monitoring", "impact": "minor", "created_at": "2026-03-30T12:36:18.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-07-08T14:22:28.487Z", "monitoring_at": "2026-07-08T14:22:28.469Z", "resolved_at": null, "started_at": "2026-03-30T12:36:18.000Z", "shortlink": "https://stspg.io/hgbbpw5mr1nq", "scheduled_for": null, "scheduled_until": null, "components": [{"id": "c71wld8bwy5k", "name": "BHS", "status": "operational"}, {"id": "k7rpdll3t1xr", "name": "DE", "status": "operational"}, {"id": "5m5v67m3y5qq", "name": "GRA", "status": "operational"}, {"id": "23s8x0xgynhd", "name": "EU-SOUTH-MIL", "status": "operational"}, {"id": "vyrmw9gt8908", "name": "AP-SOUTH-MUM", "status": "operational"}, {"id": "1x6qmwk8ms3n", "name": "EU-WEST-PAR", "status": "operational"}, {"id": "j6r12ry5hbdv", "name": "RBX", "status": "operational"}, {"id": "xtz7hwxcvxmx", "name": "SBG", "status": "operational"}, {"id": "ppg956f53vy1", "name": "SGP", "status": "operational"}, {"id": "jx9chj9gttk4", "name": "UK", "status": "operational"}, {"id": "f30yvv554lb0", "name": "US-EAST-VA", "status": "operational"}, {"id": "lrcxv21dmz6y", "name": "US-WEST-OR", "status": "operational"}, {"id": "1djy1p3h9t4t", "name": "WAW", "status": "operational"}], "incident_updates": [{"status": "monitoring", "body": "We have new information regarding the incident that affected your service(s).\n\nPlease find below an update on the situation:\n<b>Update :</b> PostGIS support for PostgreSQL 18 was introduced in a newer PostGIS version. However, an identified defect carries a risk of data corruption for geospatial data, so we have chosen not to enable it on our offer yet. We are waiting for a PostGIS release that fixes this issue before allowing PostGIS to be used on PostgreSQL 18.\nAs a reminder, this only affects customers using the PostGIS extension. PostgreSQL instances that do not use PostGIS are not impacted.\nIn the meantime, we still strongly recommend that PostGIS users postpone any upgrade to PostgreSQL 18 and remain on PostgreSQL 17, which is fully compatible with PostGIS.\n<b>Ongoing Actions :</b> The incident has been identified and corrected. It is being closely monitored to ensure long-term stability.\n\nWe will keep you updated on the progress and resolution.\n\nWe apologize for any inconvenience caused and appreciate your understanding.", "created_at": "2026-07-08T14:22:28.469Z"}]}], "scheduled_maintenances": [{"id": "v8n6twz4x9tm", "name": "[GLOBAL][Data & Analytics] - Data Platform maintenance notification", "status": "scheduled", "impact": "maintenance", "created_at": "2026-10-05T15:47:13.657Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-05T15:47:13.788Z", "monitoring_at": null, "resolved_at": null, "started_at": "2026-10-05T15:47:13.651Z", "shortlink": "https://stspg.io/n29tb84kbp0j", "scheduled_for": "2026-10-19T12:00:00.000Z", "scheduled_until": "2026-10-19T15:00:00.000Z", "components": [{"id": "1m0dyvn10ht4", "name": "Data & Analytics || Data Platform", "status": "operational"}], "incident_updates": [{"status": "scheduled", "body": "As part of our continuous improvement plan, maintenance is scheduled on our Data Platform offer.\n\n<b>Start time :</b> 19/10/2026 12:00 UTC\n<b>End time :</b> 19/10/2026 15:00 UTC\n<b>Service impact :</b> No service impact is expected.\n<b>Service improvement :</b> As part of our continuous improvement policy, we will be doing a maintenance on our Data Platform infrastructure.\n\nThank you for your understanding.", "created_at": "2026-10-05T15:47:13.784Z"}]}, {"id": "2www3mz08578", "name": "[AP-SOUTH][LocalZones] - Maintenance notification", "status": "scheduled", "impact": "maintenance", "created_at": "2026-09-30T13:10:45.819Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-30T13:10:45.961Z", "monit